            "paragraph": "The current version of the PMOD composite, d41_62_1003 (Fr\u00f6hlich 2000), covers the period 1978 to present. It is composed of data from four radiometers: NIMBUS7/HF, SMM/ACRIM I, UARS/ACRIM II and the SOHO/VIRGO instrument (see references within Fr\u00f6hlich & Lean 1998).",
